<h2>A-Series</h2>
<p>
  Flagship A-series chips from A14 to A19 Pro. Where both standard and
  Pro variants exist, the Pro is used. Efficiency is estimated at a
  typical iPhone thermal budget of ~5 W. Hardware ray tracing arrived
  with A17 Pro.
</p>

